# Felwood & Winterspring (54-56): the second Horde visit of Felwood and Winterspring, with the
# Linken chain through Tanaris and Un'Goro Crater, Ketharas and the Wild God on Mount Hyjal, and the
# road home through Azshara, Orgrimmar and Undercity, for a Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/felwood_winterspring_54_56.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Felwood, area 361,
# Winterspring, area 618, and Mount Hyjal, area 616). The guide's quest list is section 21 of
# addon/guides/horde_40_60_allocation.md.
# Carried in: The Videre Elixir (3909) and Falling to Corruption (5084), from Donova Snowden (guide
# 18); Cleansed Water Returns to Felwood (5159), from Islen Waterseer; The New Springs (980), from
# the Un'Goro guide; Delivery to Andron Gant (3542), from Jediga in Azshara; Seeping Corruption
# (3568), from Chemist Cuely in Undercity, its vials filled in Azshara.
# Left to later guides: The Everlook Report (6029), Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff (6030), Sister Pamela
# (5601) and Andron's Payment to Jediga (3564), for the Plaguelands. Wild Guardians (4741) and
# Aquementas (4005) are taken by Winterspring (58-59) itself.
# Left out: Cortello's Riddle (626), handed in in the Hinterlands, which this guide does not visit
# (Gammerita, Mon! 7816 is done in The Hinterlands (48-49)); Betrayed (3507), which can no longer be taken (Betrayed 3506 is gone);
# Feathers for Nafien (8467), not in the game client; The Staff of the Mountain (90647), which needs
# three level 58-59 Mount Hyjal chains (Stolen Life, Ashes of the Legion Ascent, A Bit of the Sky).
# Added, to open quests of the list: One Person's Trash (94479, the Loose Cog by Ketharas' cave),
# Premiere Parts (92008, Kaylaena), Mending Communications (93197, Sebelia), The Dying God (96321,
# Velician), An Oldstone But An Old Friend (96131, the Curious Crow), The Ancient, Orokai (96209),
# Stolen Power (95006) and The Pact (93773), in Moonglade.
#
# The route: Timbermaw Hold (where the Azshara guide ends) and the Deadwood of Felpaw Village;
# through the tunnel to Winterspring (Salfa, Donova Snowden) and Everlook; a flight south for
# Gaeriyan in Tanaris and Linken in Un'Goro Crater; Bloodvenom Post, the Emerald Sanctuary and
# Jaedenar; the Irontree Woods; east into Mount Hyjal to Ketharas and up to the summit; Everlook,
# Moonglade and back to Hyjal; the last of Winterspring and Donova; Felwood's hand-ins; Azshara's
# Legashi Stronghold; Orgrimmar and the zeppelin to Undercity.

guide Felwood & Winterspring (54-56)
faction horde
levels 54 56
carry 980 1123 3542 3568 3909 5084 5159
leave 1123 3564 5601 6029 6030
next Western & Eastern Plaguelands (56-58)

# Timbermaw Hold and Felpaw Village ----------------------------------------------------------------

map Felwood
accept 87346
tip Gorn One Eye stands inside Timbermaw Hold, where the Azshara guide ends. He offers this only if you handed in Timbermaw Reinforcements; if you skipped the Ursolan quests, right-click to skip it, and Blackmaw Counter-Offensive later too.
accept 8461
tip Nafien waits at the foot of the ramp up to the Timbermaw tunnel.
do 8461 bg
do 87346
tip Chieftain Bloodmaw, a level 55 elite, walks among the huts of Felpaw Village. Clear around him first. Kill the Deadwood Avengers first in any pull: they enrage when a furbolg dies near them.
turnin 5084
accept 5085
tip The Deadwood Cauldron bubbles at the north end of the village.
do 8461
accept 8470
tip The Deadwood Ritual Totem is a rare drop from any Deadwood furbolg here: keep killing them until it drops.
do 8470 mobs 7156 7157 7158 at 62.2,9.0 "Kill Deadwood furbolgs until you are Neutral with Timbermaw Hold"
tip Each Deadwood killed raises your Timbermaw reputation. Kernda takes the totem only at Neutral; you pass her again at the end of the guide.
turnin 8461
accept 8465
turnin 87346
accept 86814
tip Keep the Timbermaw War Banner: this one is done in Azshara at the end of the guide.

