# Shadow Hold: Arko'narin --------------------------------------------------------------------------

accept 5202 at 36.5,56.0
tip The Blood Red Key is a rare drop from the Jaedenar satyrs and demons inside Shadow Hold, the cave at the south end of Jaedenar.
turnin 5202
accept 5203
tip Captured Arko'narin is caged on the upper floor of the cave.
do 5203 at 35.5,59.1 "Escort Arko'narin out of Shadow Hold"
tip Keep her alive until she is out of the cave. She has about 6,000 health: let her tank. Put out the braziers of Dousing the Flames as you pass them. When she puts her armor back on, three Felguards appear: kill them, then follow her out, where the Spirit of Trey Lightforge waits.

