# Jaedenar's masters, the statue, the Irontree Woods -------------------------------------------------

do 5242
tip Shadow Lord Fel'dan stands with Moora and Salia at the north end of Jaedenar. Pull the two felhounds first, then the warlock. Wait out of his line of sight by the doorway so his Shadow Bolts fail and he comes to you.
accept 86612
tip The Statue of Malorne stands on the rise east of Jaedenar; take the bauble at its feet. Winna wants it, at the end of the guide.
do 5086 bg
do 4084.2
tip Irontree Stompers walk the dead woods of the north; the Toxic Horrors pool among them and drop their droplets rarely.
do 5086 at 49.7,25.0
do 4084.1 mobs 8957 8961 8960 at 54.0,24.0
tip The Angerclaw Grizzlies and Felpaw Ravagers east of the woods finish the claws.

